left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Alert Preferences" as SAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Access Consolidated Financial Dashboard" as CFR012
  usecase "CFR009: Manage Relationship with Advisors" as CFR009
  usecase "SAFR003: Configure Analysis Parameters for Segments" as SAFR004

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data in a dashboard.
  Client --> CFR002 : Receive alerts about anomalous transactions (FATF).
  Client --> CFR003 : View future predictions based on history and trends.
  Client --> CFR004 : Get personalized recommendations aligned with profile.
  Client --> CFR005 : Adjust personalization settings for recommendations.
  Client --> CFR006 : See alerts when spending exceeds limits in categories.
  Client --> CFR007 : Discover investment options matching risk profile (MiFID II).
  Client --> CFR012 : Access a single view of all financial info.
  Client --> CFR009 : Control data sharing with advisors for privacy.

  SysAdmin --> SAFR003
}

